# Project: soft-gate-comic-admin-dashboard

SoftGate Comic Admin Dashboard — production-grade React dashboard for managing webtoons, episodes, comments, users, and analytics.

## Stack at a glance

- **React 18** + **TypeScript 5**
- **Vite 5** — build tool, dev server
- **Tailwind CSS v3** — style config (`tailwind.config.js`)
- **ESLint 9** + **Prettier 3** + `prettier-plugin-tailwindcss`
- **Vitest 4** + Testing Library + jsdom
- **Express 5** — sibling `backend/` workspace (`npm run dev:api`)
- **PostgreSQL + Prisma 6** — `backend/.env` `DATABASE_URL` (never `VITE_*`)
- **Husky 9** + **lint-staged 15** — git hooks

## Entry points

- `index.html` → `src/main.tsx` → `<App />` (`src/App.tsx`)
- `global.css` — Tailwind import + styling
- `vite.config.ts` — app build config
- `vitest.config.ts` — test config

## Top-level commands

```bash
npm run dev          # vite dev server (port 5173)
npm run dev:api      # Express in backend/ (PORT default 3000)
npm run build        # tsc -b && vite build (Admin only)
npm run preview      # serve production build
npm run lint         # eslint . (ignores backend/)
npm run format       # prettier --write (src/ + wiki/ + backend/src/)
npm run format:check # prettier --check
npm run test         # vitest (watch, Admin src/)
npm run test:run     # vitest run (single)
npm run check        # lint + format:check + test:run + build + backend check  ← pre-push
```

## Where things live

| Area | Location |
|---|---|
| App source | `src/` |
| HTTP API | `backend/` (npm workspace; not mixed into Vite) |
| Tests | `src/test/` or next to source files; API tests in `backend/src/*.test.ts` |
| Wiki (AI knowledge base) | `wiki/` |
| Agent operating contract | `AGENTS.md` (root) + `.agents/AGENTS.md` (Antigravity mirror) |
| Project rules (Cursor) | `.cursor/rules/` |
| Project skills (Cursor) | `.cursor/skills/` |
| Project skills (Trae) | `.trae/skills/` |
| Git hooks | `.husky/` |
